[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3395484451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568#issuecomment-3395484451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568","id":3395484451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KYvsj","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-12T23:59:48Z","updated_at":"2025-10-12T23:59:48Z","body":"Doesn't Filament's implementation of sheen basically duplicate our implementation of rim lighting?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3395484451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3395622482","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568#issuecomment-3395622482","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568","id":3395622482,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KZRZS","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-13T01:49:56Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T01:49:56Z","body":"> Doesn't Filament's implementation of sheen basically duplicate our implementation of rim lighting?\r\n\r\nNo, because unlike rim, sheen is more standard and is PBR, which provides more accurate results and is absolutely necessary for https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1934.\r\n\r\nWe could categorize it as a replacement and deprecate rim, but rim would still be ideal for mobile renders and compatibility since, as I mentioned, the sheen effect wouldn't be available due to the lack of the SheenLUT in those renders. Although there's a possibility of making an analytical approximation of the Sheen LUT, as is already done with the [BRDF LUT](https://www.unrealengine.com/en-US/blog/physically-based-shading-on-mobile), but I don't have the knowledge of how that's done.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3395622482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3397323132","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568#issuecomment-3397323132","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568","id":3397323132,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Kfwl8","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-13T12:27:33Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T12:27:33Z","body":"Comparison between sheen and rim lighting: ![sheen](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40f5de1d-126b-4a61-8a81-1f4aee795bc1)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3397323132/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3398747798","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568#issuecomment-3398747798","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568","id":3398747798,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KlMaW","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-13T19:15:30Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T19:15:30Z","body":"How difficult is it to add to mobile? I am a part of V-Sekai development community focuses on providing social VR functionality for the open source Godot Engine.\r\n\r\nThe current mobile render is the one that is recommended for virtual reality headsets that run on android os.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3398747798/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3398797921","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568#issuecomment-3398797921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568","id":3398797921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KlYph","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-13T19:33:47Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T19:39:56Z","body":"@Fire The problem is the IBL part, since it requires a Sheen LUT and this is calculated in [integrate_dfg.glsl](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/integrate_dfg.glsl#L124-L136), but this is only available in Forward+ because for mobile and compatibility, it was decided to continue using an analytical approximation of the BRDF([see](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_mobile/scene_forward_mobile.glsl#L1801-L1810)) to avoid having to read the DFG LUT texture, as far as I know, most mobile devices struggle with texture reads.\r\n\r\nSo, as I mentioned, there might be a possibility of making an analytical approximation with the Sheen LUT, but I don't know how to do that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3398797921/reactions","tota